### WD-1912 — Order/createForzaGuide
# Resuelve la orden dentro de la organización del token (cualquier origen). Si no
# existe y la organización tiene Odoo habilitado, corre el MISMO sync de Odoo de
# Reactive (Foundation.IntegrationSyncService) y vuelve a buscar. No crea órdenes,
# clientes ni sucursales: para eso están el sync, v3/Customer y v3/Location.
# Luego emite la guía de Forza ligada a la orden (idempotente por orden).
# Requiere integración Forza habilitada en la organización.
# El municipio va como HeaderCodeTownship de Forza (guide.shipping.townshipCode,
# ver getForzaTownships).

### 1) Orden de Odoo por número de venta (si aún no está en Reactive, el sync la importa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderNumber": "S01476" },
  "guide": {
    "serviceType": "STD",
    "recipient": { "phone": "23456789", "email": "recepcion@prueba.test" },
    "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101", "address1": "12 calle 1-25 zona 10" },
    "packages": { "count": 1, "totalWeightKg": 2.5, "declaredValue": 150.00, "description": "Medicamentos", "fragile": true }
  }
}

### 2) Misma orden otra vez → guía reutilizada (guide.reused = true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderNumber": "S01476" },
  "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } }
}

### 3) Forzar guía adicional
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderNumber": "S01476" },
  "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" }, "allowAdditionalGuide": true }
}

### 4) Venta con varios despachos: elegir uno con dispatchNumber
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderNumber": "S01474", "dispatchNumber": "LSFE/OUT/01151" },
  "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } }
}

### 5) Orden de Reactive por id (cualquier origen: Manual, Import, ...)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderId": 1 },
  "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } }
}

### 6) COD (contra entrega)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderNumber": "S01475" },
  "guide": {
    "serviceType": "COD",
    "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" },
    "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" },
    "packages": { "count": 1, "totalWeightKg": 1, "declaredValue": 250.00, "description": "Pedido COD" },
    "cod": { "amount": 250.00, "bankId": "1", "bankAccountName": "Farmacia X, S.A.", "bankAccountId": "0123456789", "bankAccountType": "MONETARIA" },
    "allowAdditionalGuide": true
  }
}

### 7) EXPRESS (entrega en centro express de Forza)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": { "orderNumber": "S01475" },
  "guide": {
    "serviceType": "EXPRESS",
    "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" },
    "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" },
    "expressCenterCode": "226952",
    "allowAdditionalGuide": true
  }
}

### 8) Errores: sin townshipCode → 400 VALIDATION_FAILURE
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderNumber": "S01476" }, "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "address1": "x" } } }

### 9) Errores: venta en borrador en Odoo (sin despacho, el sync no la trae) → 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderNumber": "S01310" }, "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } } }

### 10) Errores: venta con dos despachos sin dispatchNumber → 409 ORDER_AMBIGUOUS
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderNumber": "S01474" }, "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } } }

### 11) Errores: despacho cancelado en Odoo → 409 ORDER_CANCELLED
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderNumber": "S01474", "dispatchNumber": "LSFE/OUT/01149" }, "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } } }

### 12) Errores: orden inexistente (Reactive y Odoo) → 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/createForzaGuide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderNumber": "S09999" }, "guide": { "serviceType": "STD", "recipient": { "phone": "23456789" }, "shipping": { "townshipCode": "0101" } } }
